  "description": "DynamicDI scans assemblies for classes decorated with `[Service]` and registers them in an `IServiceCollection`. Service lifetime and service types can be configured through the attribute. If service types are not specified, the library uses the interfaces implemented by the class. If the class implements no interfaces, the concrete class type is registered.",
